            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              The agent platform signs a short-lived passport with Ed25519 — PASETO v4 envelope,
              24h max lifetime, agent identity plus capability scope plus trust tier. Keys live
              in a managed HSM or hardware-attested enclave.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="step-card p-7 rounded-xl border border-[color:var(--color-border)] bg-[color:var(--color-bg-elevated)]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="step-icon flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg text-[color:var(--color-accent-bright)]">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
